{"id":"n81452-1-9","stage":5,"title":"탄수화물 · 碳水化合物","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81452-1-9-1","ko":"운동을 열심히 하는데도 살이 잘 빠지지 않아.","zh":"我虽然很努力锻炼，但体重就是降不下来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"운동을","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"3","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동을","audio":"/audio/0ba24f283476666840e3.mp3"}},{"text":"열심히","meaning":"认真地","explanation":"열심히：认真地","readings":[{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67512","senseId":"1","lemma":"열심히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}},{"text":"하는데도","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는데도","audio":"/audio/7dcfee060544c0a15107.mp3"}},{"text":"살이","meaning":"肉","explanation":"살：肉；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66883","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살이","audio":"/audio/10d950f9fb857268bb30.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"빠지지","meaning":"掉，减轻，变瘦","explanation":"빠지다：掉，减轻，变瘦；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"빠지다","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66637","senseId":"10","le